      "summary": "Thinly sliced fennel and soaked yellow onion with orange and grapefruit segments, Kalamata olives and a lemon–olive oil dressing.",
      "method_md": "## 🥗 Fennel & Citrus Salad (Yellow Onion + Kalamata)\n### Ingredients\n- 1 fennel bulb (very thinly sliced)\n- ⅓ small yellow onion (thinly sliced)\n**Citrus**\n- 1 orange + ½ grapefruit (segmented)\n**Dressing**\n- Zest ½ lemon\n- 1½ tbsp lemon juice\n- 3 tbsp olive oil\n**Other**\n- 25 g Kalamata olives (sliced)\n- ¼–½ tsp kosher salt\n- Black pepper\n### Method\n- Soak onion 15–20 min, drain.\n- Combine fennel + onion.\n- Add lemon zest, juice, olive oil.\n- Add citrus (gently).\n- Add olives.\n**Balance**\n- Adjust acid/oil first.\n- Salt last.\n**Rest**\n- 10–15 min at room temp.",
